        "rephrase": {
          "p_ql1": "Fine-tuned an 8B Llama 3.1 model with QLoRA (4-bit, Unsloth, TRL) on a 15 GB GPU, training 0.52% of parameters, raising answer completion from 32% to 52% and exact-answer accuracy from 16.2% to 27.3% on 99 NuminaMath problems.",
          "p_ql3": "Reported that accuracy on completed answers improved only from 50% to 52%, attributing the gain to finishing answers within the token budget rather than stronger reasoning, and traced out-of-memory errors to multiple models loaded in one runtime.",
          "p_ia1": "Designed preprocessing and clustering pipelines (K-Means, HAC, DBSCAN) using BoW, TF-IDF, Skip-gram, and SBERT, and traced silhouette scores below 0.30 to repeated template vocabulary in support tickets."
        },
        "profile": "AI engineer who builds the harness around the model: at AstraZeneca I built a tool-calling LLM agent that recovers when its tools fail, and diagnosed its failures with a three-tier, ~65-test evaluation harness. Production LLM agent work on an AstraZeneca-affiliated multi-omics research platform. Builds deployable ML models: forecasting (an LSTM time-series service), propensity modelling (an XGBoost churn classifier with Bayesian tuning and SMOTE) and customer segmentation (k-means, HAC and DBSCAN)."
      },
